comments, and is tested there.\n- [ ] Both stores pass a contract for `record_items` and `heads`, with the GitHub adapter checked against recorded GitHub payloads.\n- [ ] `scripts/check` passes\n- [ ] No UI change\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tibbe/linewright/issues/1158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tibbe/linewright/issues/1158/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}